<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπέτομαι </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διΐπταμαι</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdn.
		</span></i>, v.infr.), aor.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-επτάμην</span> (v. infr.): aor.
		
			Act.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έπτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					9.4
				</span></i>
			: pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπέταται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1310
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπωτᾶται</span>
			:—<i>fly through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ δ᾽ ἔπτατο πικρὸς ὀϊστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.99
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρᾷς τὸν ἁβρὸν οὗ βέλος διέπτατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					860
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. διὰ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1217
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1086
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fly away, vanish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπτομένη οἴχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					70a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				84b
			</span></i>, etc.; of Time, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				507
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of a
			report, <i>fly in all directions,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διϊπταμένη ἡ φήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.8.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
